### Gamma function tgamma(me) via DD. Crashes if non-finite (poles at 0 and neg ints).
### :returns: The gamma function of `me`.
### :throws: {NumericDomainError} on NaN (neg int poles); {NumericOverflowError} on ±inf.
routine D64.tgamma!() -> D64
  var r = me.tgamma_unchecked()
  if r.is_finite()
